# What a source deploy must NOT upload.
#
# The Dockerfile copies pyproject.toml, README.md and src/ and nothing else, so everything here is
# weight on the wire rather than anything the image could use. `research/` alone is 497 MB and is
# a separate uv project on a different interpreter that rule 11 forbids the product to import.
#
# Without this file gcloud synthesises one from .gitignore, which keeps the gitignored corpora out
# but still ships every tracked research file, every test and the whole of .git.
.git/
.gitignore
research/
tests/
docs/
.venv/
.verify-clone/
.verify-pack.db
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.pytest_cache/
.hypothesis/
**/__pycache__/
*.pyc
.env
